    "justification": "Synthetic live-builder canary for Phoenix-bench-shaped hierarchy debugging work: the builder receives a concrete downstream signal-routing failure, must trace causality through interacting local files, patch the upstream registry root cause, and leave machine-checkable causal-trace evidence. No past KOTA failure run exists for this exact measurement gap, so this is a smoke fixture rather than a regression-gated real-failure fixture."
